        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "My sword can't reach them! They're not like the other monsters we've fought before!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Marcille! Use your magic already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I got caught in the blast!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*! They can use both explosion and freezing magic, and target them with precision. These things sure are something!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're too quick, I can't aim like this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do we do then?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We run! I'll use my magic to counter theirs! Try to get out of their range!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
