    {
        "text": "With a massive boom, the buildings are set ablaze, and the ringing of the blast is closely followed by the shouting of the villagers. After the explosion comes the falling magic items, which careen into a few unlucky souls."
    },
    {
        "text": "Marcille can't help but tighten her grip on her staff."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think we made them really mad, Laios!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Senshi, Marcille, sometimes we just have to grit our teeth and get fighting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "text": "A shame... we still haven't found out anything about Rhodes Island...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
