        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "By golly, the Catastrophe didn't ruin none of our corn fields! Didn't get licked by the sandstorm neither!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer A"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been worried sick for days over this. If the fields're gone, we'd have nothing to eat or sell past summertime!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How bout's I go start up the drones then, boss? Other places mightn't have been as lucky. If they see we're still spick and span, we're gonna have a problem with thieves and looters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well go on then. Just 'member to switch them from patrol mode to attack mode.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh right, remember to let that Rhodes Island fella in, he's meant to be stopping by after the Catastrophe!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You got it, boss!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1,
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
