    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? That ain't right... Why's the drone relay all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer B"
    },
    {
        "text": "The drones ain't responding? Signal's... Boss! Boss!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-The Catastrophe hit the drone relay! The drones\u2014 They're outta control!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, don't lose your cool! Turn that relay off first!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't! It ain't shutting down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer B"
    },
