    {
        "text": "Hey, this is Ryan, with a new entry for the mission log.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "text": "First, bringing back Ceobe. Uh... This mission's proving a bit harder than anticipated. Our intel says this is the last place the kid showed up, but actually finding her's not so simple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I've got to pay a visit to the 'Cornhole', see how they're doing after the Catastrophe. Hope everything's alright there\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
