    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was that?! Is there a dust-up going on in the frontier?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah! The, the... Originium circuits... The mainline board...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...I don't see anyone from outside the village? Seems like they've got some kind of internal issues.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Guess I better find out what's going on. These guys aren't the friendliest bunch...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
