        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, you're a sight for sore eyes! I remember you, you're Ryan, the guy with the little hammer! Come help us out, the drones are outta control!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Phew, okay, just some out-of-control drones. If there really was fighting out here, I'd be done for...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "text": "That so? Alright, hang back a bit. I'll go take a look for you\u2014",
