        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Screw those bastards!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(This can't be good. if I get Rhodes Island involved in a frontier tussle, we'll be in trouble. L-Let's get these guys to safety first, and hopefully that'll calm things down\u2014)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, don't be rash, buddy! You don't know how many people are out there, we best hunker down for now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frick that, I saw four of 'em earlier! Go for the two shorties first!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's gettem!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer B"
    },
