        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Two groups? Be careful, they've got weapons, and more of those magic items Marcille can't do anything about. Just stay calm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "CALM?! I AM <i>DONE</i> BEING CALM! My hair's all messed up thanks to that explosion! Ruined my braid! I really liked it, you know?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You ess-oh-bees think you can mess with me? You sick freaks think you can just bomb my barn?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, stop! Let's talk it out like civilized folk! The drones are still flying around like crazy! Do you really want to pick a fight <i>now</i>?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shove it! You think I'm scared of my own drones?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What good is talking going to do when it's <i>them</i> who attacked <i>us</i> out of nowhere?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut it, lady, you're the ones who blew up my barn! You guys got a death wish\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer A"
    },
