        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah! Yowch! None of these pains-in-the-butt are listening to me\u2014 Ow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, fighting out in the wild's just going to draw in who-knows-what! Let's all calm down and talk things out, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ryan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "As though in response to his earnest plea, all of a sudden, the ground begins to rumble."
    },
    {
        "text": "Could it be another Catastrophe? The thought flits through the minds of some, but is immediately dispelled by what comes next."
    },
