    {
        "text": "A tidal wave of gloompincers seems to have had enough of the drones dropping bombs in the skies above their heads. They raise their pincers in formation and march towards the gaggle of people..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A swarm of monsters?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4143_sensi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Run! We can't handle that many with just the four of us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But there's nowhere <i>to</i> run! We're surrounded!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's just back off for now...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Chilchuck"
